<string name="oem_guidance_generic">Some manufacturers pause background voice announcements to save battery. Grant Lord TTS an exemption from battery optimization and open the app settings to confirm background announcements keep working.</string>
<string name="oem_guidance_xiaomi">Xiaomi/Redmi/POCO device: Lord TTS needs a battery optimization exemption and "Autostart" enabled under Mi security management to keep background voice announcements alive.</string>
<string name="oem_guidance_huawei">Huawei/Honor device: enable the battery exemption and "Auto-launch" under System Manager (Apps > Special) so background voice announcements keep working.</string>
<string name="oem_guidance_oppo">Oppo/OnePlus/realme device: open the battery exemption and allow Lord TTS under "Startup management" in the security center to keep background announcements alive.</string>
<string name="oem_guidance_vivo">Vivo device: enable the battery exemption and "Auto start" under the permission manager so background voice announcements keep working.</string>
<string name="oem_guidance_samsung">Samsung device: enable the battery exemption, open the app settings, and keep Lord TTS out of "Sleeping apps" so background voice announcements keep working.</string>
